Normal completion of the harness is not by itself an implicit normal postcondition.

For a prohibited-exception contract, a pattern that catches exactly that exception, records it, and asserts
that it was not observed means only that the specified exception is prohibited. Uncaught exception classes
do not become additional prohibited exceptions under the host semantics above.

